{
  "name": "VeyCall: WhatsApp Business (text and voice notes)",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "291e55a9-de52-5747-85c9-ae8f4bd7c112",
      "name": "Setup",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## VeyCall: WhatsApp Business\n\nYour VeyCall agent answers your WhatsApp Business number (Meta's Cloud API): **texts get a text, voice notes get a voice note in your agent's voice.**\n\n1. **WhatsApp Trigger**: connect your Meta app (*WhatsApp OAuth*). Read receipts are filtered out.\n2. **Get the voice note**, **Download**, **Send text**, **Send voice note**: your *WhatsApp API* credential (access token and business account id). Replies go from the number that received the message.\n3. **VeyCall node**: create a *VeyCall API* credential with your organization API key (`vc_live_…`, VeyCall dashboard; needs the *API and webhooks* activation), then pick your agent.\n4. Activate.\n\nMeta allows free replies within 24 hours of the customer's last message.\n\nPrefer your usual WhatsApp number with no Meta setup? Use *Integrations › WhatsApp* in VeyCall (QR code) instead.",
        "width": 560,
        "height": 560,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8d670111-8480-5cfb-961d-722090922f99",
      "name": "WhatsApp Trigger",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.whatsAppTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        0,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "updates": [
          "messages"
        ],
        "options": {
          "messageStatusUpdates": []
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "8ec23abb-46f7-5015-aba7-7844afba247a",
      "name": "Read messages",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "jsCode": "// WhatsApp Cloud API events -> one item per customer message (text, button, caption or voice note).\nconst out = [];\nfor (const item of $input.all()) {\n  const v = item.json;\n  for (const msg of v.messages ?? []) {\n    const contact = (v.contacts ?? []).find((c) => c.wa_id === msg.from) ?? v.contacts?.[0] ?? {};\n    const text = msg.text?.body ?? msg.button?.text ?? msg.interactive?.button_reply?.title ?? msg.interactive?.list_reply?.title ?? msg.image?.caption ?? msg.video?.caption ?? msg.document?.caption ?? '';\n    out.push({\n      json: {\n        phone_number_id: v.metadata?.phone_number_id,\n        from: msg.from,\n        name: contact.profile?.name ?? '',\n        id: msg.id,\n        text: String(text).slice(0, 8000),\n        audio_id: msg.type === 'audio' ? msg.audio?.id ?? '' : '',\n      },\n    });\n  }\n}\nreturn out;"
      }
    },
